counterfactuals.output:
1. An image processing apparatus comprising:

a threshold-changing unit configured to change a threshold used to classify pixels of an image;

a display-control unit configured to cause a display device to display the image in a display state corresponding to the threshold changed by the threshold-changing unit;

a region-designation receiving unit configured to receive a designation of a region within the image displayed on the display device; and

a threshold-fixing unit configured to fix the threshold based on pixel values of pixels included in the designated region.
